 Michael viene così trascinato in un mondo fatto di ritmi martellanti, spirito di fratellanza e droga. Quando il traffico di stupefacenti di Danny assume dimensioni internazionali, i due fratelli si ritrovano a dover lottare per la propria vita."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"17-year-old Michael dreams of a future as a pianist, but his music education is not going smoothly. In his search for inspiration, he receives help from an unexpected source: his brother Danny introduces him to the emerging Rotterdam “gabber” music scene. Michael is drawn into a world of hard beats, brotherhood and drugs. When Danny's drug business reaches international proportions, the brothers must fight for their lives.","tagline":"ROTTERDAM. 1996. 180 BPM."},{"language":"nl-NL","overview":"De 17-jarige Michael droomt van een toekomst als pianist, maar zijn muziekopleiding loopt niet van een leien dakje. In zijn zoektocht naar inspiratie krijgt hij hulp uit onverwachte hoek: zijn broer Danny introduceert hem in de opkomende Rotterdamse gabber-scene. Michael wordt een wereld ingezogen van snoeiharde beats, broederschap en drugs.","tagline":"010. 1996. 180 BPM."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jEea1a6YcKp9TaTRwO3FxdoHZWj.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z6qMaqU9clsrqyAPIclFlVtZjyl.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1103789,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"nl-NL","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jEea1a6YcKp9TaTRwO3FxdoHZWj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jEea1a6YcKp9TaTRwO3FxdoHZWj.jpg","language":"it","width":1170,"height":1732},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jEea1a6YcKp9TaTRwO3FxdoHZWj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jEea1a6YcKp9TaTRwO3FxdoHZWj.jpg","language":"it","width":1170